* INPUT DEMO
* ----------
* Reads lines from the "input data" textarea and echoes them to OUTPUT.
* Reading the special variable INPUT consumes one line; when there is no
* more data the read FAILS, and :F(DONE) branches to the DONE label.
* Try editing the input data on the right and re-running.
READ   LINE = INPUT                :F(DONE)
       OUTPUT = LINE               :(READ)
DONE   OUTPUT = 'End of input'
END
